; payload.hasm — the three words tb_gowin_loader sends down the wire.
;
; Small on purpose. The boot path is what is under test, not the program: if
; three words arrive at 64, 65 and 66 and then run, the wire format, the write
; port and the address auto-advance are all proved at once. Anything longer
; would only add ways for the test to fail for reasons that are not the boot
; path's fault.
;
; The bench pins the encodings (0x0490002a, 0x04a00007, 0x01000000), so this
; file and that expectation have to be read together.
        MOVI  R9, 42
        MOVI  R10, 7
        HALT
